rn, in view, inside awareness","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:1678"},{"name":"feared_flee_distance","donor_constant":"3 (flee when under 3, resume at 3 or more; no band)","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:1772"},{"name":"fear_ignore_distance","donor_constant":"4 (monsterFleesFrom returns false at 4 or more)","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:2962"},{"name":"invulnerable_keepaway_distance","donor_constant":"6","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:2954"},{"name":"near_death_enter_pct","donor_constant":"25 (maxHP/4)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:1779"},{"name":"near_death_recover_pct","donor_constant":"75 (3 x maxHP/4)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:1807"},{"name":"enrage_turns","donor_constant":"4","unit":"ticks","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Combat.c:332"},{"name":"enrage_release_hp_pct","donor_constant":"50 (maxHP/2)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:1495"},{"name":"ally_flee_distance","donor_constant":"10","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:3000"},{"name":"ally_flee_hp_pct","donor_constant":"33","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:3001"},{"name":"wake_teammate_ticks","donor_constant":"100","unit":"ticks","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Monsters.c:1591"},{"name":"scent_clock_wrap","donor_constant":"above 20000, subtract 15000","unit":"count","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/tmewett-BrogueCE/src/brogue/Time.c:2270"}],"best_idea":"One clock stamps the player's trail, so a monster's perceived distance is trail age plus distance, and it loses the player on a three-band rule (inside awareness it holds the chase at 97% per tick, beyond three times awareness it drops at once) instead of on a timer.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"Take the three awareness bands and the 25% notice roll with the stealth range as the radius; refresh the scent field only for zones with a player inside (cost cap); seed the draws per creature; add a band to the feared-enemy flee (donor has none, flee under 3 and resume at 3 flickers); keep the near-death 25/75 band as it is.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A server test with a seeded RNG: a hunting creature inside awareness keeps the chase on about 97% of ticks; beyond three times awareness it drops the player on the same tick; a near-death flee creature at 60% HP stays fleeing and recovers to tracking at 75% HP."}
